WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.250
- I wish there was just more compassion.

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:03.990
No, we don't wanna make
something difficult.

00:00:03.990 --> 00:00:05.560
We just wanna be acknowledged.

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:08.883
My daughter was a victim,
and she's being punished.

00:00:10.181 --> 00:00:13.181
(suspenseful music)

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:17.728
- Hey guys, welcome to another episode

00:00:17.728 --> 00:00:19.580
of The Wednesday Checkup.

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:22.540
Sorry we're in the crazy furry rug space

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:23.610
here today at YouTube,

00:00:23.610 --> 00:00:26.570
but I wanted to get this
video out as soon as possible.

00:00:26.570 --> 00:00:28.210
When I heard that there was a video made

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:30.990
between anti-vax and pro-vaccine folks,

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:33.320
I decided to watch it
and give you my reaction

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.470
live right here first time watching it.

00:00:35.470 --> 00:00:36.450
- I'm Bob Sears.

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:37.780
I'm a pediatrician.

00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:40.270
- A pediatrician who's anti-vaccine.

00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:41.103
Interesting.

00:00:41.103 --> 00:00:43.290
- It is passion is just to help encourage

00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:46.710
a full, complete, informed
consent for vaccinations.

00:00:46.710 --> 00:00:48.720
- Doesn't sound like he's anti-vaccine.

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:51.670
He said he's in favor of informed consent.

00:00:51.670 --> 00:00:54.680
I think all doctors,
at least they should be

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:56.100
for informed consent.

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:57.230
Curious where this is going.

00:00:57.230 --> 00:00:59.750
- Well I was vaccinated as a child,

00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:02.440
but my last vaccine was about 15 years ago

00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:04.970
when I returned to college,

00:01:04.970 --> 00:01:09.320
and I had a severe
reaction in that I became

00:01:09.320 --> 00:01:11.040
arthritic in my hands.

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:13.070
Went to many, many
doctors, and nobody knew

00:01:13.070 --> 00:01:14.820
what was going on and
why it was happening.

00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:16.740
And just shrugged like
it doesn't make sense,

00:01:16.740 --> 00:01:18.460
you're too young to have arthritis.

00:01:18.460 --> 00:01:22.710
And it wasn't until having
kids and digging into my own

00:01:22.710 --> 00:01:26.040
research for them that a lot of answers

00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:26.910
started coming up,

00:01:26.910 --> 00:01:29.670
and I think it's unfortunate
that a lot of it is overlooked.

00:01:29.670 --> 00:01:31.270
- I guess maybe I'll participate in this.

00:01:31.270 --> 00:01:32.960
This could be a cool way to do it.

00:01:32.960 --> 00:01:34.280
I am vaccinated.

00:01:34.280 --> 00:01:36.650
If I was to have children,
they'd be vaccinated,

00:01:36.650 --> 00:01:38.990
and I am a doctor who's pro-vaccine.

00:01:38.990 --> 00:01:41.930
Becoming an anti-vaccine activist based on

00:01:41.930 --> 00:01:44.110
your own experience of
having a negative outcome

00:01:44.110 --> 00:01:46.800
to a vaccine to me is not wise,

00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:48.660
and I'll point out why I believe that.

00:01:48.660 --> 00:01:51.271
If you look at the
statistical evidence between

00:01:51.271 --> 00:01:53.360
the harms that could come from vaccines,

00:01:53.360 --> 00:01:54.630
because there are some harms,

00:01:54.630 --> 00:01:56.680
and then you look at
what you're preventing,

00:01:56.680 --> 00:01:58.200
essentially what are the benefits?

00:01:58.200 --> 00:02:00.490
What diseases are you
preventing by getting a vaccine?

00:02:00.490 --> 00:02:02.290
There's so much benefit there.

00:02:02.290 --> 00:02:04.680
Horrible that the mothering activist

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:06.320
had this thing happen to her,

00:02:06.320 --> 00:02:10.050
but it shouldn't be the
sole reason for why someone

00:02:10.050 --> 00:02:11.970
believes that vaccines are bad

00:02:11.970 --> 00:02:13.450
and that they're anti-vaccine.

00:02:13.450 --> 00:02:15.630
- I will acknowledge, of
course as a pediatrician,

00:02:15.630 --> 00:02:17.400
I know vaccines work.

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:19.270
I know they give you protection.

00:02:19.270 --> 00:02:21.850
They vary greatly in
what that protection is.

00:02:21.850 --> 00:02:25.563
It's not like 100% magical
shield over you completely.

00:02:25.563 --> 00:02:27.420
- I don't understand
where this doctor falls

00:02:27.420 --> 00:02:29.510
under anti-vaccine, if that's his stance.

00:02:29.510 --> 00:02:31.220
- I think when you're
giving kids medication,

00:02:31.220 --> 00:02:32.780
you have to get micro about it.

00:02:32.780 --> 00:02:35.680
I don't think it's doing
your kids any service

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:38.650
to just say vaccines
are all made the same,

00:02:38.650 --> 00:02:41.430
and they're all safe and
healthy and good for you.

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:42.677
That everybody's benefiting from it,

00:02:42.677 --> 00:02:44.110
because--
- She's right.

00:02:44.110 --> 00:02:44.943
- That's false.

00:02:44.943 --> 00:02:46.010
It's not true.
- But we study them before we

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:47.130
release them to the public.

00:02:47.130 --> 00:02:49.610
We study them, so we do know they're safe.

00:02:49.610 --> 00:02:50.560
That's the thing is we know--

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:51.483
- Safe-ish.

00:02:51.483 --> 00:02:53.690
They're safe-ish.
- well safer.

00:02:53.690 --> 00:02:55.050
- You know, being an intensive,

00:02:55.050 --> 00:02:56.450
I see the worst of the worst.

00:02:56.450 --> 00:02:59.560
And so seeing the other
side of kids who don't

00:02:59.560 --> 00:03:03.660
get vaccinated, I saw a kid
walk in with Meningococcemia,

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:05.170
which I haven't seen in decades.

00:03:05.170 --> 00:03:07.070
He had all four limbs cut off.

00:03:07.070 --> 00:03:10.000
They had to be amputated
because it was all dead tissue.

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:13.470
You forget how bad things
were before we had vaccines.

00:03:13.470 --> 00:03:16.350
- I'm really proud that the
intensivist took this route,

00:03:16.350 --> 00:03:19.100
because many times
sub-specialists will often

00:03:19.100 --> 00:03:24.100
run to talking about statistics
or studies and research,

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:28.100
and to people who are not
of scientific education,

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:30.230
it's difficult to relate to that.

00:03:30.230 --> 00:03:33.080
But when you tell a powerful
story like he just did,

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:34.880
that really strikes the message home.

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:36.120
That children are dying.

00:03:36.120 --> 00:03:38.650
They're losing limbs unnecessarily.

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:40.820
I agree with the mother
on the vaccine issue.

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:42.350
This shouldn't be a macro issue.

00:03:42.350 --> 00:03:43.340
This is a micro issue.

00:03:43.340 --> 00:03:45.190
Each vaccine should be evaluated,

00:03:45.190 --> 00:03:47.670
but the truth of the matter is they are.

00:03:47.670 --> 00:03:50.040
We don't just say all vaccines are good.

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:52.270
We look at each individual vaccine.

00:03:52.270 --> 00:03:54.330
Each individual vaccine
has a different set

00:03:54.330 --> 00:03:56.930
of adverse reactions, AKA bad things

00:03:56.930 --> 00:03:59.260
that can happen as a
result of getting them.

00:03:59.260 --> 00:04:02.510
But again, the trade-off
in taking the risk

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:04.690
of having one of these adverse reactions

00:04:04.690 --> 00:04:06.710
is the protection from the disease

00:04:06.710 --> 00:04:09.310
that we hope to prevent or
even eradicate at times.

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:11.200
- I don't like the assumption

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:13.260
that if a child is unvaccinated

00:04:13.260 --> 00:04:15.920
some how they are of risk to everyone.

00:04:15.920 --> 00:04:19.010
And also knowing that
vaccinated individuals

00:04:19.010 --> 00:04:21.010
can also be carrying
and spreading diseases.

00:04:21.010 --> 00:04:22.750
I think it's very polarizing
to separate the two

00:04:22.750 --> 00:04:24.730
as if, if you're vaccinated
you're totally fine.

00:04:24.730 --> 00:04:26.147
You're not risking anybody anything.

00:04:26.147 --> 00:04:30.110
- I disagree with her,
because if you're vaccinated,

00:04:30.110 --> 00:04:31.890
it doesn't mean you're not risking anyone.

00:04:31.890 --> 00:04:35.150
It means when you're vaccinated,
you're doing your job

00:04:35.150 --> 00:04:37.710
to protect those who cannot be vaccinated.

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:39.410
It doesn't mean that
you're a great person.

00:04:39.410 --> 00:04:43.580
It doesn't speak to your
lack of ability to do harm,

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:45.260
but that's not what the
point of the issue is.

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:46.710
The point of the issue is

00:04:46.710 --> 00:04:48.880
if you choose not to
vaccinate your children,

00:04:48.880 --> 00:04:50.560
and you're okay with your child

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:52.600
getting measles or one of these illnesses,

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:55.010
what about the children that
have an immunodeficiency

00:04:55.010 --> 00:04:57.300
or have some sort of other issue

00:04:57.300 --> 00:04:59.000
that they can't get vaccines?

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:01.370
And as a result of that,
your child then spreads

00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:03.450
a deadly illness to them and they die too.

00:05:03.450 --> 00:05:05.620
- Anybody could be spreading diseases,

00:05:05.620 --> 00:05:07.930
especially things like Polio and Pertussis

00:05:07.930 --> 00:05:10.650
that are not completely
covered by the vaccine.

00:05:10.650 --> 00:05:13.110
- Again, I agree that
not everybody's covered,

00:05:13.110 --> 00:05:16.260
but if you can reduce that
likelihood, why wouldn't you?

00:05:16.260 --> 00:05:17.760
- I started out vaccinating my daughter,

00:05:17.760 --> 00:05:19.810
because I believed all the
same things that you said.

00:05:19.810 --> 00:05:22.940
It wasn't until she had a
reaction and several reactions

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:24.610
that I actually had to
look at it differently

00:05:24.610 --> 00:05:28.560
where I realized by continuing
vaccinating for her,

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:29.970
that actually would hurt her.

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:33.010
And yet everyone wants me
to do it for the population.

00:05:33.010 --> 00:05:34.970
- This is a very specific situation.

00:05:34.970 --> 00:05:36.570
This is where things get tricky.

00:05:36.570 --> 00:05:39.990
If you're having adverse
reactions to vaccines,

00:05:39.990 --> 00:05:42.000
I don't think there's
any doctor in the world

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:45.150
who says continue getting
vaccines to protect all of us.

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:47.200
It doesn't matter if the
vaccines hurt your daughter.

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:49.010
In fact, one of the first questions I ask

00:05:49.010 --> 00:05:50.507
before I administer vaccines is

00:05:50.507 --> 00:05:52.840
have you ever had adverse events?

00:05:52.840 --> 00:05:53.740
What were they?

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:56.190
And we investigate them
prior to giving vaccines.

00:05:56.190 --> 00:05:59.130
If your child for some
reason cannot get a vaccine

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:00.590
because of adverse events,

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:02.130
you fall into the population

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:04.300
that needs to be protected
by herd immunity.

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:06.546
- A number of families
who look into vaccines,

00:06:06.546 --> 00:06:09.910
they will decide to opt out of vaccines,

00:06:09.910 --> 00:06:12.961
because they feel they
are just not willing to

00:06:12.961 --> 00:06:14.797
risk the side effects.

00:06:14.797 --> 00:06:18.320
- But the side effects
are one in a million,

00:06:18.320 --> 00:06:19.450
one in two million,

00:06:19.450 --> 00:06:21.380
whereas the side effects from the diseases

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:23.740
when I see all these outbreaks
and things like that,

00:06:23.740 --> 00:06:25.381
I'm gonna choose vaccines every time.

00:06:25.381 --> 00:06:26.320
- And that's, I think right there,

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:28.340
is the disservice to this conversation,

00:06:28.340 --> 00:06:30.700
because it is a risk benefit analysis.

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:33.980
And what's unfortunate is how
downplayed those risks are.

00:06:33.980 --> 00:06:35.850
I only started investigating vaccines

00:06:35.850 --> 00:06:38.600
because I ended up with a kid
with an autoimmune disorder.

00:06:38.600 --> 00:06:40.019
- Autoimmune disorders have been present

00:06:40.019 --> 00:06:41.810
before vaccinations were.

00:06:41.810 --> 00:06:44.930
What's interesting here
is, yes, it may not be

00:06:44.930 --> 00:06:46.590
one in a million or one in two million,

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:48.030
or whatever the odds are.

00:06:48.030 --> 00:06:52.130
The bottom line of why it
shouldn't be an optional thing

00:06:52.130 --> 00:06:54.040
of opting out from vaccines,

00:06:54.040 --> 00:06:55.810
at least when it comes to public schools,

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:57.678
is because a, herd immunity exists,

00:06:57.678 --> 00:07:01.790
b, it's my job as the doctor
to make sure the parent

00:07:01.790 --> 00:07:03.950
is giving quality care to the child.

00:07:03.950 --> 00:07:06.340
If the child had a broken bone,

00:07:06.340 --> 00:07:08.900
and the parent wasn't
adequately treating it

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:10.550
and didn't wanna go see a doctor,

00:07:10.550 --> 00:07:12.660
and the child was suffering as a result,

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:15.130
I can report them to
the proper authorities.

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:16.890
It doesn't mean that
because they're your child,

00:07:16.890 --> 00:07:18.150
you can just do whatever.

00:07:18.150 --> 00:07:20.020
So by not getting vaccinations,

00:07:20.020 --> 00:07:22.510
it's medically and statistically proven

00:07:22.510 --> 00:07:23.940
that you're endangering your child

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:25.920
to develop these deadly diseases.

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:28.400
Therefore, we don't allow you to opt out.

00:07:28.400 --> 00:07:30.570
At least, we don't allow
you to opt out from schools,

00:07:30.570 --> 00:07:32.680
and that's sort of our
catch-all behind all this.

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:34.980
- The one in a million
is not a real number.

00:07:34.980 --> 00:07:35.837
- It's really not.

00:07:35.837 --> 00:07:36.930
- And so the more that

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:37.890
that is put out,
- It is.

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:39.380
It's public.
- so people think that,

00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:40.310
No, it's not.

00:07:40.310 --> 00:07:41.154
Not when you're talking about

00:07:41.154 --> 00:07:42.510
the different kinds of reactions.

00:07:42.510 --> 00:07:44.270
- I think the number you're referring to

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:46.205
is anaphylactic shock.

00:07:46.205 --> 00:07:49.370
Anaphylactic shock is, of
course, extremely rare,

00:07:49.370 --> 00:07:51.460
whereas when you look at seizures

00:07:51.460 --> 00:07:53.793
from the MMR vaccine are one in 3,000.

00:07:53.793 --> 00:07:56.970
- But again, this creates fear in parents.

00:07:56.970 --> 00:08:00.750
- Well we worry that those
on your side downplay those.

00:08:00.750 --> 00:08:02.490
- We don't necessarily downplay them.

00:08:02.490 --> 00:08:05.890
We weigh them against the
benefits of getting the vaccine,

00:08:05.890 --> 00:08:08.130
and if you're getting a
vaccine and it's preventing you

00:08:08.130 --> 00:08:09.540
from getting an illness,

00:08:09.540 --> 00:08:12.520
which vaccines have been
proven over time to do this,

00:08:12.520 --> 00:08:16.360
the one in 3,000 statistic
is difficult to conceptualize

00:08:16.360 --> 00:08:18.610
for a parent, because
they don't know how often

00:08:18.610 --> 00:08:20.610
the actual disease occurs.

00:08:20.610 --> 00:08:24.220
As a result of this, we as
doctors make the recommendation

00:08:24.220 --> 00:08:27.230
that taking the one in 3,000
risk of having a seizure

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:29.870
is worth it to prevent this
deadly illness from happening.

00:08:29.870 --> 00:08:31.410
- I don't think it's an idea of downplay.

00:08:31.410 --> 00:08:32.770
I think it comes back
to what we were saying

00:08:32.770 --> 00:08:34.730
with the risk benefit analysis,

00:08:34.730 --> 00:08:36.880
and I think the data's very clear.

00:08:36.880 --> 00:08:39.230
- It's so hard not to talk about data

00:08:39.230 --> 00:08:41.200
when you're talking about
vaccines as a doctor,

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:43.830
but unfortunately when you're
trying to influence someone

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:45.670
and you're trying to change
their mind on something,

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:46.560
it doesn't work well.

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:48.690
And I imagine this is
gonna fall on deaf ears.

00:08:48.690 --> 00:08:49.700
- It's hard to trust someone

00:08:49.700 --> 00:08:52.978
who sees your child for
10 minutes twice a year.

00:08:52.978 --> 00:08:56.150
In the end, parents know
their children best.

00:08:56.150 --> 00:08:58.600
- I actually very much
disagree with that statement.

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:01.426
The closer you are in
relation to the patient,

00:09:01.426 --> 00:09:04.270
the more likely that your
bias is gonna be at play.

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:07.050
You're not gonna be able to
make an objective decision.

00:09:07.050 --> 00:09:09.210
This is why it's strongly discouraged

00:09:09.210 --> 00:09:11.380
in the medical community to take care of

00:09:11.380 --> 00:09:13.570
your own family members as a doctor.

00:09:13.570 --> 00:09:15.150
Because your judgment gets clouded,

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:16.540
and you make bad decisions.

00:09:16.540 --> 00:09:19.007
- So if you were to come
to your doctor and say,

00:09:19.007 --> 00:09:20.617
"hey my child's acting differently

00:09:20.617 --> 00:09:23.780
"after this well visit
appointment; something's wrong",

00:09:23.780 --> 00:09:26.050
you want them to trust that you have

00:09:26.050 --> 00:09:27.900
an established relationship
and listen to you.

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:29.190
- She's absolutely right.

00:09:29.190 --> 00:09:30.730
If a parent brings in a child

00:09:30.730 --> 00:09:32.250
and says they're acting differently,

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:33.920
that's a huge warning sign.

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:37.760
And any doctor that brushes
that off and says I disagree,

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:40.020
that's a bad sign from a doctor.

00:09:40.020 --> 00:09:42.420
I would actually recommend
switching doctors,

00:09:42.420 --> 00:09:44.580
or in the room, if you're comfortable,

00:09:44.580 --> 00:09:46.350
pointing that out to the
doctor that you don't think

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:48.300
that's the right method
and you're not comfortable.

00:09:48.300 --> 00:09:50.900
If they don't welcome your criticism

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:53.750
or your thoughts on the
matter, switch doctors.

00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:54.860
It's really that simple.

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:59.190
- My daughter has epilepsy, and in March,

00:09:59.190 --> 00:10:04.190
she was also diagnosed with
juvenile idiopathic arthritis.

00:10:04.410 --> 00:10:05.760
I went to the Rheumatologist,

00:10:05.760 --> 00:10:07.460
and the Rheumatologist said we're gonna

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:09.710
put her on Methotrexate,
and I looked at her.

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:10.990
I'm like Methotrexate?

00:10:10.990 --> 00:10:15.570
That's a chemotherapeutic agent
that kids with cancer get.

00:10:15.570 --> 00:10:18.710
And she's like yes, but
we use it in a low dose.

00:10:18.710 --> 00:10:20.790
And It doesn't cause harmful side effects.

00:10:20.790 --> 00:10:21.840
You have to trust me.

00:10:22.680 --> 00:10:23.723
I said okay.

00:10:25.160 --> 00:10:27.120
And I trusted her.

00:10:27.120 --> 00:10:29.350
And I am so glad that I did.

00:10:29.350 --> 00:10:32.140
Before all this happened,
she was a competitive gymnast

00:10:32.140 --> 00:10:34.300
and she used to walk
up and down the stairs

00:10:34.300 --> 00:10:35.480
like she was 90 years old.

00:10:35.480 --> 00:10:37.510
She couldn't hold a pencil in her hand.

00:10:37.510 --> 00:10:41.720
Now she's back on the
bars, back on the beam,

00:10:41.720 --> 00:10:45.460
doing things where my wife and I (coughs)

00:10:45.460 --> 00:10:46.860
never thought that she would do again.

00:10:46.860 --> 00:10:48.410
- I'm so proud of these doctors

00:10:48.410 --> 00:10:51.290
that they're coming in and really avoiding

00:10:51.290 --> 00:10:54.580
digging into data and
numbers and confusing

00:10:54.580 --> 00:10:56.230
and confounding the conversation further.

00:10:56.230 --> 00:10:58.150
They're telling personal stories.

00:10:58.150 --> 00:10:59.740
They're making it emotional.

00:10:59.740 --> 00:11:01.270
They're making it reasonable,

00:11:01.270 --> 00:11:04.000
because this is how you resonate
with another human being.

00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:05.810
It's not about pointing at a pie chart.

00:11:05.810 --> 00:11:08.460
- The people who refuse to acknowledge

00:11:08.460 --> 00:11:09.980
that vaccine reactions are happening

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:11.530
or that the things that
happened to my daughter

00:11:11.530 --> 00:11:13.850
were connected because maybe
it was just a coincidence

00:11:13.850 --> 00:11:15.710
and I just needed something to pin it on,

00:11:15.710 --> 00:11:17.170
you are socially isolated.

00:11:17.170 --> 00:11:19.450
You can be isolated by your family,

00:11:19.450 --> 00:11:21.460
isolated by the medical community,

00:11:21.460 --> 00:11:23.130
isolated by society as a whole,

00:11:23.130 --> 00:11:25.390
because they assume you're unintelligent,

00:11:25.390 --> 00:11:27.400
uneducated, and irrational.

00:11:27.400 --> 00:11:30.750
- I don't think we should
become hostile to anti-vaxxers.

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:34.400
I think the role here
is to be compassionate,

00:11:34.400 --> 00:11:36.800
and when a patient tells me something

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:39.260
that I know to be misinformation,

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:40.730
I don't get mad at the patient.

00:11:40.730 --> 00:11:44.680
The feelings that I get are
oh man, it's so unfortunate

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:46.317
that you've come to believe that.

00:11:46.317 --> 00:11:48.260
And this is what I say
to myself in my head.

00:11:48.260 --> 00:11:51.130
How can I find a common ground between us

00:11:51.130 --> 00:11:54.450
so that I can explain to you
what's actually happening

00:11:54.450 --> 00:11:57.420
or what the right steps
are to fix this situation.

00:11:57.420 --> 00:11:59.820
I think where hostility
really kicks in is not when

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:02.500
a single person refuses to
vaccinate their children,

00:12:02.500 --> 00:12:03.811
but when they become activists

00:12:03.811 --> 00:12:05.545
to try and encourage other people

00:12:05.545 --> 00:12:07.240
to not vaccinate their children.

00:12:07.240 --> 00:12:11.240
That sort of misinformation
spreading is really dangerous,

00:12:11.240 --> 00:12:14.680
and that's where it deserves
to be struck down right away,

00:12:14.680 --> 00:12:15.730
because if you're not gonna be

00:12:15.730 --> 00:12:17.220
talking about quality evidence,

00:12:17.220 --> 00:12:19.100
you're not gonna be talking
about expert opinion,

00:12:19.100 --> 00:12:21.820
you're just doing a huge
disservice to a lot of families.

00:12:21.820 --> 00:12:23.850
- I have a great deal of
compassion for the families

00:12:23.850 --> 00:12:27.220
that had children die
from preventable diseases.

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:28.380
There shouldn't be any hostility.

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:29.460
There should be discussion.

00:12:29.460 --> 00:12:31.300
I mean, we can always question things.

00:12:31.300 --> 00:12:32.420
That's how we evolve.

00:12:32.420 --> 00:12:33.927
That's how we get better.

00:12:33.927 --> 00:12:35.270
If we didn't question anything,

00:12:35.270 --> 00:12:37.150
we'd be still in the dark ages.

00:12:37.150 --> 00:12:38.680
- Huge fan of that doctor.

00:12:38.680 --> 00:12:39.970
I'm glad they did this,

00:12:39.970 --> 00:12:44.140
but I am also gonna be a
little bit of a skeptic here.

00:12:44.140 --> 00:12:48.700
The people that were invited
from the anti-vaccine side

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:49.980
were very reasonable.

00:12:49.980 --> 00:12:51.250
They were very logical.

00:12:51.250 --> 00:12:53.200
They talked about their own experiences.

00:12:53.200 --> 00:12:56.350
If they invited the
people that are shouting

00:12:56.350 --> 00:12:57.730
in front of doctors offices,

00:12:57.730 --> 00:12:59.530
if they invited the true activists

00:12:59.530 --> 00:13:01.510
that think doctors are killing people,

00:13:01.510 --> 00:13:02.990
if they invite some of the people

00:13:02.990 --> 00:13:06.140
that email me telling me
that I'm killing babies

00:13:06.140 --> 00:13:08.770
and that I need to watch
certain pieces of propaganda

00:13:08.770 --> 00:13:10.130
that they're spreading around,

00:13:10.130 --> 00:13:12.090
that would have been a totally
different conversation.

00:13:12.090 --> 00:13:12.923
It would have been hostile.

00:13:12.923 --> 00:13:14.030
It would have been explosive.

00:13:14.030 --> 00:13:16.960
The only way that we can
control this situation

00:13:16.960 --> 00:13:20.140
is by educating those people
that are in the middle ground.

00:13:20.140 --> 00:13:21.760
Not by telling them what to do,

00:13:21.760 --> 00:13:24.210
but by educating them, by explaining

00:13:24.210 --> 00:13:26.870
look how horrible it was
before we had vaccines.

00:13:26.870 --> 00:13:30.540
Talk to the WHO, and let
them tell you how many lives

00:13:30.540 --> 00:13:33.300
are lost every minute when children

00:13:33.300 --> 00:13:35.010
don't have money to get a vaccine.

00:13:35.010 --> 00:13:38.040
We are blessed to live in
a time and in a country

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:40.910
where vaccines are made affordable to us,

00:13:40.910 --> 00:13:42.340
made available to us.

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:44.480
In fact, we have a program in my hospital

00:13:44.480 --> 00:13:45.513
called Vaccine For Children

00:13:45.513 --> 00:13:47.910
that if you don't even
have insurance coverage,

00:13:47.910 --> 00:13:50.010
we still get vaccines for these children.

00:13:50.010 --> 00:13:52.960
These are government-aided
programs that are not for-profit.

00:13:52.960 --> 00:13:54.820
They're for protection of children.

00:13:54.820 --> 00:13:56.580
That's what vaccines are all about.

00:13:56.580 --> 00:13:58.410
They're about protecting children.

00:13:58.410 --> 00:13:59.500
They're about making sure

00:13:59.500 --> 00:14:01.500
that we get the best outcomes possible.

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:03.210
And we continue to monitor this.

00:14:03.210 --> 00:14:06.530
If new research occurs that
vaccines have a new side effect

00:14:06.530 --> 00:14:09.190
that we weren't aware of,
we take this into account,

00:14:09.190 --> 00:14:10.670
and we update our recommendations.

00:14:10.670 --> 00:14:13.500
But as of right now, the benefits outweigh

00:14:13.500 --> 00:14:15.420
the harms when it comes to vaccines,

00:14:15.420 --> 00:14:17.380
and you should vaccinate your children,

00:14:17.380 --> 00:14:19.270
just as I will mine in the future,

00:14:19.270 --> 00:14:21.210
and I recommend the
same to all my patients.

00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:23.690
If you're still curious to
learn more about vaccines,

00:14:23.690 --> 00:14:25.760
click here for my vaccine video.

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:28.464
As always, stay happy and healthy.

00:14:28.464 --> 00:14:31.631
(slow tranquil music)

